   431	    39	Given a hash-bound three-case fixture with four independent search routes per case
   432	    40	When the regression suite is deserialized and evaluated
   433	    41	Then deterministic full coverage, route increments, leave-one-route-out loss, gaps, and bounded human minutes are returned
   434	    42	And the result remains a passive evaluation artifact
   435	    43	```
